# Benchmark corpora and run output. All of it is derived from examples/, which is itself
# gitignored and purged from history — so none of it has a source git can track, and a corpus
# committed here would be a snapshot nobody can regenerate or diff meaningfully. Rebuild with
# scripts/build_{translation,ocr,qa}_corpus.py; see docs/benchmarks_guide.md §5.
# The durable record is scripts/examples_manifest.json, which stays tracked.
scripts/corpus/*
scripts/ocr_corpus/*
scripts/qa_corpus/*
runs/*